# Style for NEW first-party code (the post-2026-08 extracted modules:
# tx_fsm, mission_logic, mission_state, region_policy, gnss_acquire,
# packet_queue, nvm_slot, ...). CubeIDE-generated 2-space files (main.c,
# lora_app.c, ...) are exempt in practice until their refactors land: the
# changed-lines check (tools/check_format.sh) is report-mode while the
# 2-space/4-space split is unresolved - see FINDINGS.md (Phase 3).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
